{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","特制香薰"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","制造香薰并持续恢复生命，主动使用可以升级香薰。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始后，在自己周围2格范围内制造并持续施法维持香薰。香薰存在时，自身每秒回复50点能量，在香薰内的友军每秒回复-21% ATK生命值。主动使用时，立即为香薰内的友军回复 170% + 15% ATK生命值，并使香薰的效果永久升级。第一次升级效果：香薰的作用范围扩大1格。第二次升级效果：受影响的友军获得额外30点急速。被动地，当自身受到打断效果影响时，香薰将会中断，且后续4秒内自身将无法再制造香薰。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":91,"end":97,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":57,"end":65,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":87,"end":101,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":170,"end":174,"tooltip_key":"keyword:interrupteff"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每秒生命回复量提高至-24% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每秒生命回复量提高至-27% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每秒生命回复量提高至-29% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","每秒生命回复量提高至-31% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","提神配方"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","香薰内的友军提升攻击力，并为自己额外恢复能量。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","香薰内的友军提升16% + 1%攻击力。每个受影响的非召唤物友军，会使自身每秒额外回复5点能量。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","香薰内的友军提升18% + 1%攻击力。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每个受影响的非召唤物友军，会使自身每秒额外回复8点能量。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","香薰内的友军提升20% + 1%攻击力。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","速效愈合"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","为香薰内的友军恢复生命。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","为香薰内的全体友军回复自身-90% − 10% ATK的生命值。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","回复量提升至-100% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","回复量提升至-110% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","回复量提升至-120% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力，香薰内非召唤物友军数量不少于3个时进一步提升攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高6%攻击力。当香薰内除自身以外的非召唤物友军数量不少于3个时，自身额外提升9%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高8%攻击力。当香薰内除自身以外的非召唤物友军数量不少于3个时，自身额外提升12%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高10%攻击力。当香薰内除自身以外的非召唤物友军数量不少于3个时，自身额外提升15%攻击力。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","枯萎药剂"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","香薰可以额外升级一次。满级后可对敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“特制香薰”获得第三次升级效果：香薰的作用范围额外扩大1格。在“特制香薰”首次获得第三次升级时，香薰将会获得持续10秒的强化，每秒使香薰内的敌人流失12%最大生命值，这部分生命流失量最高不超过自身200%攻击力。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","香薰强化期间，每秒使敌人流失的最大生命值比例提高至14%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","香薰强化期间，每次使敌人流失生命时，还会将其眩晕0.1秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","香薰强化期间，每秒使敌人流失的最大生命值比例提高至15%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“特制香薰”主动使用时的生命回复量提高。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“特制香薰”主动使用时的生命回复量额外提高30% ATK 。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","摇摆香炉"]]}